# Source is never ignored. The patterns above are for build output and the
# scratch files a working tree collects (`*.html`, `*.svg`, `*.txt`, `*.pdf`,
# `*.log`), and they swallowed a web console's own `index.html`: `git add`
# skipped it without a word, and the binary that `include_str!`s it then failed
# to compile — in CI, on every platform at once. Anything under `src/` is part
# of the program.
!src/**/*.html
!src/**/*.svg
!src/**/*.txt
